 ## Why Freebuff?
 
 **Choice of leading models** — The regular CLI picker includes MiMo v2.6 Flash Fast, GLM 5.3 Flash, DeepSeek, DeepSeek V4.1 Flash Fast, GPT-6 Luna, MiMo 2.6 Pro, Solar Mini 4, Solar Pro 4, Space Bunny Alpha, Gemini 3.8 Flash, Muse Spark 1.3, Gemini 4 Argon, and GPT-6.1 Sol, with MiMo v2.6 Flash Fast selected by default.
 
 **Fast** — 5–10× speed up. 3–5× tokens per second compared to Claude, plus context gathering in seconds.
 
 **Loaded** — Built-in web research, browser use, and more.
 
 ## FAQ
 
 **How can it be free?** Freebuff is supported by text ads.
 
 **What models do you use?** In full mode, the regular picker includes MiMo v2.6 Flash Fast, GLM 5.3 Flash, DeepSeek V4.1 Flash, DeepSeek V4.1 Flash Fast, GPT-6 Luna, MiMo 2.6 Pro, Solar Mini 4, Solar Pro 4, Space Bunny Alpha, Gemini 3.8 Flash, Muse Spark 1.3, Gemini 4 Argon, and GPT-6.1 Sol. Space Bunny Alpha is a beta stealth model from an anonymous provider that retains prompts. Gemini 3.8 Flash and Muse Spark 1.3 require a paid plan: without one they are listed but locked, and selecting one opens the plans page. Gemini 4 Argon and GPT-6.1 Sol are free in the US and need a paid plan elsewhere, and every account, paid or not, gets one session a day on each; Gemini 4 Argon's price is a temporary promotion. GPT-6 Luna and MiMo 2.6 Pro are open to every full-access account. DeepSeek V4.1 Flash Fast is fast mode: the same model on DeepSeek's own API, splitting work across parallel subagents. Muse Spark 1.3 has a 1M-token context, and when it is busy or unavailable it answers on DeepSeek V4.1 Flash instead of leaving you waiting. MiMo v2.6 Flash Fast is the CLI default, and GLM 5.3 Flash is the cheapest model to run. Limited mode uses MiMo v2.6 Flash Fast, GLM 5.3 Flash, DeepSeek V4.1 Flash, Solar Mini 4, Solar Pro 4, and Space Bunny Alpha; the models a paid plan unlocks there are listed too, locked until you have one. Every model is paid for in hours, one multiplier per one-hour session, shown in the model picker: an hour of MiMo v2.6 Flash Slow uses one hour of balance, a 3x model uses three. Models may still serve from a quantized (Q8_0) build.
 
 **Which countries is Freebuff available in?** All countries. Freebuff runs in "full" mode in the US, Canada, UK, EU, and other select countries, and in "limited" mode everywhere else (or while using a VPN). See [freebuff.com](https://freebuff.com) for the full list.
 
 **What is limited mode?** Limited mode lets you use Freebuff outside the full-access countries, or while using a VPN. It includes GLM 5.3 Flash, DeepSeek V4.1 Flash, MiMo v2.6 Flash Fast, Solar Mini 4, Solar Pro 4, and Space Bunny Alpha. The free limited-access allowance is 5 hours a day, or 4 on a VPN or proxy, and each model's multiplier per one-hour session is shown in the picker. Today's allowance is spent first, whichever model you pick, including GLM 5.3 Flash; Hours you earn on the Earn page go into your wallet and are used once today's allowance runs out.
 
